var GR=[["Arrow, Acid",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Acid, with no save."],["Arrow, Alchemist's Fire",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Alchemist's Fire, with no save."],["Arrow, Armor-Piercing",20,0.05,"Ammunition","Works like an Armor-Piercing melee weapon: +1 to attack rolls against a target wearing armor or with AC 18 or higher."],["Arrow, Blessed",20,0.05,"Ammunition","The weapon's damage becomes Radiant. A Fiend, Fey or Undead target hit has its Speed cut by 10 ft and cannot take Reactions until the end of its next turn."],["Arrow, Bludgeoning",0.05,0.1,"Ammunition","Advanced ammo that deals Bludgeoning damage (blunt tips). It is heavier, so the weapon's maximum range is halved."],["Arrow, Brutal",20,0.05,"Ammunition","Works like a Brutal melee weapon: Critical Hit range grows by 1 and a Critical Hit adds one extra damage die."],["Arrow, Desecrated",20,0.05,"Ammunition","The weapon's damage becomes Necrotic. A Celestial, Humanoid or Plant target hit has its Speed cut by 10 ft and cannot take Reactions until the end of its next turn."],["Arrow, Holy Water",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Holy Water, with no save."],["Arrow, Incendiary",20,0.05,"Ammunition","A hit deals an extra 1d4 Fire damage."],["Arrow, Ranging",0.1,0.025,"Ammunition","Lighter, better made ammo: you can raise the weapon's normal range by 50 percent."],["Arrow, Slashing",0.1,0.1,"Ammunition","Advanced ammo that deals Slashing damage (wide heads). It is heavier, so the weapon's maximum range is halved."],["Arrow, War Oil",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use. A hit deals normal damage and coats the target in War Oil for up to 1 minute. You can instead hit AC 10 at a point to spill a 10-ft-radius patch. War Oil is Difficult Terrain, and a creature that starts its turn there or first enters it on a turn makes a DC 10 Dexterity save or falls Prone with Speed 0 until the end of that turn. If a coated creature or area meets open flame or Fire damage, the oil burns for 2 rounds: 2d4 Fire to anything touching it, plus 2d4 Fire to a creature that ends its turn in it. An action douses a burning creature. The oil dries after burning twice, being doused, or 1 minute unlit."],["Arrow, Whistling",0.1,0.05,"Ammunition","Whistles in flight, audible out to 300 ft. Its maximum range is half normal and it deals Bludgeoning damage."],["Bolt, Acid",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Acid, with no save."],["Bolt, Alchemist's Fire",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Alchemist's Fire, with no save."],["Bolt, Armor-Piercing",20,0.1,"Ammunition","Works like an Armor-Piercing melee weapon: +1 to attack rolls against a target wearing armor or with AC 18 or higher."],["Bolt, Blessed",20,0.1,"Ammunition","The weapon's damage becomes Radiant. A Fiend, Fey or Undead target hit has its Speed cut by 10 ft and cannot take Reactions until the end of its next turn."],["Bolt, Bludgeoning",0.05,0.1,"Ammunition","Advanced ammo that deals Bludgeoning damage (blunt tips). It is heavier, so the weapon's maximum range is halved."],["Bolt, Brutal",20,0.1,"Ammunition","Works like a Brutal melee weapon: Critical Hit range grows by 1 and a Critical Hit adds one extra damage die."],["Bolt, Desecrated",20,0.1,"Ammunition","The weapon's damage becomes Necrotic. A Celestial, Humanoid or Plant target hit has its Speed cut by 10 ft and cannot take Reactions until the end of its next turn."],["Bolt, Holy Water",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Holy Water, with no save."],["Bolt, Incendiary",20,0.1,"Ammunition","A hit deals an extra 1d4 Fire damage."],["Bolt, Ranging",0.1,0.025,"Ammunition","Lighter, better made ammo: you can raise the weapon's normal range by 50 percent."],["Bolt, Slashing",0.1,0.1,"Ammunition","Advanced ammo that deals Slashing damage (wide heads). It is heavier, so the weapon's maximum range is halved."],["Bolt, War Oil",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use. A hit deals normal damage and coats the target in War Oil for up to 1 minute. You can instead hit AC 10 at a point to spill a 10-ft-radius patch. War Oil is Difficult Terrain, and a creature that starts its turn there or first enters it on a turn makes a DC 10 Dexterity save or falls Prone with Speed 0 until the end of that turn. If a coated creature or area meets open flame or Fire damage, the oil burns for 2 rounds: 2d4 Fire to anything touching it, plus 2d4 Fire to a creature that ends its turn in it. An action douses a burning creature. The oil dries after burning twice, being doused, or 1 minute unlit."],["Bolt, Whistling",0.1,0.05,"Ammunition","Whistles in flight, audible out to 300 ft. Its maximum range is half normal and it deals Bludgeoning damage."],["Paper Cartridge Bullet, Armor-Piercing",50,0.1,"Ammunition","Works like an Armor-Piercing melee weapon: +1 to attack rolls against a target wearing armor or with AC 18 or higher."],["Paper Cartridge Bullet, Blessed",50,0.1,"Ammunition","The weapon's damage becomes Radiant. A Fiend, Fey or Undead target hit has its Speed cut by 10 ft and cannot take Reactions until the end of its next turn."],["Paper Cartridge Bullet, Brutal",50,0.1,"Ammunition","Works like a Brutal melee weapon: Critical Hit range grows by 1 and a Critical Hit adds one extra damage die."],["Paper Cartridge Bullet, Desecrated",50,0.1,"Ammunition","The weapon's damage becomes Necrotic. A Celestial, Humanoid or Plant target hit has its Speed cut by 10 ft and cannot take Reactions until the end of its next turn."],["Paper Cartridge Bullet, Incendiary",50,0.1,"Ammunition","A hit deals an extra 1d4 Fire damage."],["Sling Bullet, Acid",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Acid, with no save."],["Sling Bullet, Alchemist's Fire",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Alchemist's Fire, with no save."],["Sling Bullet, Armor-Piercing",20,0.1,"Ammunition","Works like an Armor-Piercing melee weapon: +1 to attack rolls against a target wearing armor or with AC 18 or higher."],["Sling Bullet, Blessed",20,0.1,"Ammunition","The weapon's damage becomes Radiant. A Fiend, Fey or Undead target hit has its Speed cut by 10 ft and cannot take Reactions until the end of its next turn."],["Sling Bullet, Brutal",20,0.1,"Ammunition","Works like a Brutal melee weapon: Critical Hit range grows by 1 and a Critical Hit adds one extra damage die."],["Sling Bullet, Desecrated",20,0.1,"Ammunition","The weapon's damage becomes Necrotic. A Celestial, Humanoid or Plant target hit has its Speed cut by 10 ft and cannot take Reactions until the end of its next turn."],["Sling Bullet, Holy Water",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use, hit or miss. On a hit it deals normal damage and then applies the effect of Holy Water, with no save."],["Sling Bullet, Incendiary",20,0.1,"Ammunition","A hit deals an extra 1d4 Fire damage."],["Sling Bullet, Piercing",0.01,0.1,"Ammunition","Advanced ammo that deals Piercing damage (faceted bullets). It is heavier, so the weapon's maximum range is halved."],["Sling Bullet, Ranging",0.05,0.05,"Ammunition","Lighter, better made ammo: you can raise the weapon's normal range by 50 percent."],["Sling Bullet, War Oil",75,0.2,"Ammunition","Alchemical ammunition: halves the weapon's normal and long range and is destroyed on use. A hit deals normal damage and coats the target in War Oil for up to 1 minute. You can instead hit AC 10 at a point to spill a 10-ft-radius patch. War Oil is Difficult Terrain, and a creature that starts its turn there or first enters it on a turn makes a DC 10 Dexterity save or falls Prone with Speed 0 until the end of that turn. If a coated creature or area meets open flame or Fire damage, the oil burns for 2 rounds: 2d4 Fire to anything touching it, plus 2d4 Fire to a creature that ends its turn in it. An action douses a burning creature. The oil dries after burning twice, being doused, or 1 minute unlit."],["Sling Bullet, Whistling",0.05,0.05,"Ammunition","Whistles in flight, audible out to 300 ft. Its maximum range is half normal and it deals Bludgeoning damage."],["Bellows Cannister",0.25,0.2,"Ammunition","Ammunition for the Flame Bellows. A magazine holds 20."],["Dragon Shot",0.25,0.1,"Ammunition","Ammunition for Dragon Pistol and Dragon Rifle."],["Paper Cartridge Bullet",0.15,0.1,"Ammunition","Ammunition for blackpowder weapons."],["Blessed Stake",250,0.1,"Adventuring Gear","Melee attack with Strength for 1d4 Piercing. Against a Vampire that is Stunned or Incapacitated, a hit kills it. A Vampire of CR 10 or lower crumbles to dust at once. A stronger one stays whole for 1 year and then crumbles. If the stake is pulled out before then, it rises with 1 Hit Point."],["Breath of Beleth",150,0.25,"Adventuring Gear","Inhaled poison. A creature breathing in the same space as the open container makes a DC 15 Constitution save or is Poisoned for 1 minute. While Poisoned this way it is also Frightened and Hostile to every creature it sees. If a creature comes within 5 ft of it, it must Dash away on its turn. If it cannot, it uses the Attack action against that creature."],["Buckler",20,4,"Adventuring Gear","Worn on the forearm for +1 AC. It can also be used as a Martial melee weapon with the Light property dealing 1d4 Bludgeoning."],["Concealed Blade",50,2,"Adventuring Gear","A Dagger hidden in a bracer or gauntlet. When you roll Initiative, make a Dexterity (Deception) check against enemies' Wisdom (Perception). You have Advantage on your first attack in the first round against any enemy that failed."],["Fire Bomb",100,0.5,"Adventuring Gear","Thrown with the Attack action at a space you can see within 20 ft. A creature there makes a DC 15 Dexterity save. On a fail it takes 2d6 Slashing and 4d6 Fire damage and starts Burning. Adjacent creatures take half and do not Burn."],["Grappling Gun",200,3,"Adventuring Gear","Shoots a Grappling Hook on a rope up to 150 ft. The hook catches on a DC 10 Dexterity (Acrobatics) check. While falling, you can use a Reaction to fire it at a surface to stop your fall, if the check succeeds."],["Iron Net",150,20,"Adventuring Gear","Works as a normal Net with these changes: range 10 ft, escape DC 15 on the Strength (Athletics) check, and the net has AC 13 and 15 HP."],["Magazine",5,1,"Adventuring Gear","Holds ammunition for a weapon with the Magazine property. Swapping one is a Bonus Action."],["Mastercraft Instrument",250,0,"Adventuring Gear","A secretly enhanced instrument. If you are proficient with it and your Proficiency Bonus is +4 or higher, you have Advantage on Charisma (Performance) checks made with it."],["Noisemaker",50,5,"Adventuring Gear","Utilize action: throw it into a space within 60 ft. It makes a loud noise heard up to half a mile. A creature with Intelligence 3 or lower within 60 ft makes a DC 10 Wisdom save or is Frightened for 1 minute. Another creature can use an Influence action for a DC 20 Wisdom (Animal Handling) or Charisma (Persuasion) check to end it."],["Prosthetics",500,10,"Adventuring Gear","A creature with a Grievous Wound ignores its penalties while wearing a Prosthetic that replaces the damaged body part. Some can be enchanted."],["Retractable Shield",300,6,"Adventuring Gear","Worn as a bracer, and the hand stays free while it is retracted. Reaction when an attack hits you: extend it for a bonus to AC equal to your Proficiency Bonus against that attack. If this turns the hit into a miss, you may make one melee weapon or Unarmed Strike attack against the attacker if it is in reach. It stays extended until the start of your next turn. You can extend or retract it as a free object interaction on your turn. While extended it occupies your hand and gives +2 AC."],["Seeing Glass",300,3,"Adventuring Gear","A silver hand mirror whose reflection shows any creature's true form, as Truesight. Turned on a vampire, it shatters and is destroyed."],["Shadowsteel Focus",500,0,"Adventuring Gear","A Spellcasting Focus holding Shadowsteel. Any focus can be made this way. It gives no benefit on its own, but a caster with the Shadowsteel Adept and Shadowsteel Master feats gains those feats' benefits when using it."],["Smoke Bomb",50,3,"Adventuring Gear","Utilize action: throw the vial up to 30 ft. It makes a 10-ft-radius Sphere of smoke, Heavily Obscured, lasting 1d4 + 2 rounds (half as long in wind)."],["Stitching Needle",250,0.05,"Adventuring Gear","Sewing a creature's mouth shut ends its speech and spells with verbal components, but it gains Telepathy out to 60 ft. Stitching a willing, Unconscious or Incapacitated creature takes 10 minutes. Removing the stitches takes 1 minute."],["Tower Shield",200,50,"Adventuring Gear","Gives +3 AC while wielded. Needs Strength 15 and lowers your Speed by 10 ft while wielded. Set it with an action to have Cover until the start of your next turn, with Speed 0 that cannot be raised during that time."],["Watcher's Candle",250,0.25,"Adventuring Gear","A black candle that cannot be lit by hand. It ignites with a purple flame when a Celestial, Fey, Fiend or Undead comes within 120 ft, then burns for 1 hour and cannot be used again. It does not work wrapped or stowed in a container."]];
